msgstr "Nastavitve dostave po e-pošti"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Instance.tpl
msgid "Link to "
msgstr "Povezava do "

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Instance.tpl
msgid ""
"All report instances are automatically included in the Report Listing page. "
"Check this box to also add this report to the navigation menu."
msgstr "Vsi primerki poročil so samodejno vključeni na stran s seznamom poročil. Označite to polje, če želite poročilo dodati tudi v navigacijski meni."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Instance.tpl
msgid ""
"If set to Yes, this report will appear in the My Reports section of the "
"reports listing page and will only be visible by you."
msgstr "Če izberete »Da«, bo to poročilo prikazano v razdelku »Moja poročila« na strani s seznamom poročil in bo vidno samo vam."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Instance.tpl
msgid ""
"If reserved, only users with 'administer reserved reports' permission can "
"modify this report instance."
msgstr "Če je primerek rezerviran, ga lahko spreminjajo samo uporabniki z dovoljenjem »upravljanje rezerviranih poročil«."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Instance.tpl
msgid ""
"Users with appropriate permissions can add this report to their dashboard."
msgstr "Uporabniki z ustreznimi dovoljenji lahko to poročilo dodajo na svojo nadzorno ploščo."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Instance.tpl
msgid "rows"
msgstr "vrstic"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/OrderBy.tpl
msgid "Section Header / Group By"
msgstr "Glava razdelka / združevanje po"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/OrderBy.tpl
msgid "remove sort by column"
msgstr "odstrani stolpec za razvrščanje"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"A copy of this report can be automatically generated and delivered via email"
" to specified recipients. Use the settings in this section to control "
"Subject of the email containing the report, as well as the recipient list "
"(To and Cc fields). You can only specify one 'To' email, but you can "
"separate multiple 'CC' email addresses with commas."
msgstr "Kopija tega poročila se lahko samodejno ustvari in po e-pošti dostavi določenim prejemnikom. Z nastavitvami v tem razdelku določite zadevo e-pošte s poročilom in seznam prejemnikov (polji Za in Kp). Določite lahko samo en e-poštni naslov v polju »Za«, več naslovov v polju »Kp« pa ločite z vejicami."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Your site administrator will need to setup an instance of the Scheduled Job "
"\"Mail Reports\" to trigger creation and delivery of each report. When "
"invoked, this job will deliver email to the recipients specified for the "
"report. The report can be attached to the email as a PDF file (default), as "
"a CSV file, or included in HTML format."
msgstr "Skrbnik spletnega mesta mora nastaviti primerek načrtovanega opravila »Pošiljanje poročil«, ki sproži ustvarjanje in dostavo posameznega poročila. Ob zagonu opravilo pošlje e-pošto prejemnikom, določenim za poročilo. Poročilo je mogoče e-pošti priložiti kot datoteko PDF (privzeto) ali CSV oziroma ga vključiti v obliki HTML."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"This title and the description below will be displayed to users in the "
"reports list when they click the 'Reports Listing' menu. The title should "
"reflect the report's default criteria. EXAMPLE: Activity Report - Current "
"Month"
msgstr "Ta naslov in spodnji opis bosta uporabnikom prikazana na seznamu poročil, ko kliknejo meni »Seznam poročil«. Naslov naj odraža privzeta merila poročila. PRIMER: Poročilo o dejavnostih - trenutni mesec"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"The Report Header contains HTML code that will be output at the beginning of"
" the document whenever this report is printed or downloaded in PDF format. "
"The default values will work for most situations. However you may want to "
"enter the actual report title in the &lt;title&gt; tag (replacing 'CiviCRM "
"Report'). You can include a logo by adding an &lt;img&gt; tag. You can also "
"modify the look and feel of the printed report by including a custom CSS "
"file (instead of print.css)."
msgstr "Glava poročila vsebuje kodo HTML, ki se izpiše na začetku dokumenta ob vsakem tiskanju poročila ali prenosu v obliki PDF. Privzete vrednosti ustrezajo večini primerov. V oznako &lt;title&gt; lahko vnesete dejanski naslov poročila (in nadomestite »CiviCRM Report«). Logotip lahko vključite z oznako &lt;img&gt;. Videz natisnjenega poročila lahko spremenite tudi z vključitvijo lastne datoteke CSS (namesto print.css)."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"The Report Footer HTML code will be output at the end of the document. You "
"can add any additional footer text, replace the CiviCRM logo, or make other "
"changes as needed."
msgstr "Koda HTML noge poročila se izpiše na koncu dokumenta. Dodate lahko dodatno besedilo noge, zamenjate logotip CiviCRM ali po potrebi uvedete druge spremembe."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"You can control access to this report by selecting a 'Permission' from the "
"list, or selecting one or more Roles. For example, you might select "
"<em>access CiviContribute</em> for contribution reports (e.g. the same "
"people who can see contribution data would also have access to the report). "
"You can also prevent users from modifying the default report criteria and "
"filters for reports by NOT giving them <em>access Report Criteria</em> "
"permission. Those users will be able to run the report - but only with the "
"criteria and filters that you've established for them."
msgstr "Dostop do tega poročila lahko nadzorujete tako, da na seznamu izberete »Dovoljenje« ali eno oziroma več vlog. Pri poročilih o prispevkih lahko na primer izberete <em>dostop do CiviContribute</em>, da bodo do poročila dostopale iste osebe, ki lahko vidijo podatke o prispevkih. Uporabnikom lahko preprečite spreminjanje privzetih meril in filtrov poročila tudi tako, da jim NE dodelite dovoljenja <em>dostop do meril poročil</em>. Ti uporabniki bodo poročilo lahko zagnali, vendar samo z merili in filtri, ki ste jih zanje določili."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"You can make this report instance available for users to include in their "
"CiviCRM 'Home Dashboard' by checking this box. Users with appropriate "
"permissions will see the report in the 'Available Dashlets' box when they "
"'Configure' their dashboard. If you want to make a graphic version of the "
"report available, select the desired 'View' and click 'Update Report'. You "
"may want to create a set of report instances specifically for use as "
"dashlets (and you can choose to NOT include them in the navigation menu if "
"you want to distinguish these from the reports that users typically utilize "
"in full screen mode)."
msgstr "Ta primerek poročila lahko uporabnikom omogočite za vključitev na domačo nadzorno ploščo CiviCRM, tako da označite to polje. Uporabniki z ustreznimi dovoljenji bodo poročilo videli v polju »Razpoložljivi gradniki«, ko izberejo možnost »Nastavi« na nadzorni plošči. Če želite omogočiti grafično različico poročila, izberite želeni »Pogled« in kliknite »Posodobi poročilo«. Ustvarite lahko poseben nabor primerkov poročil za uporabo kot gradnike; če jih želite ločiti od poročil, ki jih uporabniki običajno uporabljajo v celozaslonskem načinu, jih lahko izključite iz navigacijskega menija."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"If you need to make a dashlet NOT available, AND remove it from existing "
"user dashboards - you can do that from the 'Configure' screen on your "
"dashboard. Click the 'x' on the right side of the dashlet's icon."
msgstr "Če želite preprečiti razpoložljivost gradnika IN ga odstraniti z obstoječih uporabniških nadzornih plošč, to storite na zaslonu »Nastavi« na svoji nadzorni plošči. Kliknite »x« na desni strani ikone gradnika."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"The default number of rows per page for most reports is 50. However, this "
"may be too many for a report which is included in the 'Home Dashboard'. You "
"can reduce the number of rows included in each page when the report is part "
"of the Dashboard by entering the desired row count here. Users will still be"
" able to navigate through the full report using a pager."
msgstr "Privzeto število vrstic na stran je pri večini poročil 50. To je lahko preveč za poročilo, vključeno na domačo nadzorno ploščo. Število vrstic na posamezni strani poročila na nadzorni plošči lahko zmanjšate tako, da tukaj vnesete želeno število. Uporabniki bodo s krmilnikom strani še vedno lahko pregledali celotno poročilo."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"How often should the contents of this dashlet be automatically refreshed? "
"Users can manually reload by clicking the refresh button on their "
"dashboards."
msgstr "Kako pogosto naj se vsebina tega gradnika samodejno osveži? Uporabniki jo lahko ročno znova naložijo s klikom gumba za osvežitev na nadzorni plošči."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Users with 'administer reserved reports' permission can mark a report "
"instance as reserved, which prevents other users from accessing or modifying"
" Report Criteria and Report Settings. This is particularly useful for report"
" instances whose criteria affect the data available on non-report screens. "
"For example, the display columns configured for the  Contact Logging Summary"
" affect the columns shown under each contact's Change Log tab."
msgstr "Uporabniki z dovoljenjem »upravljanje rezerviranih poročil« lahko primerek poročila označijo kot rezerviran in tako drugim uporabnikom preprečijo dostop do meril in nastavitev poročila ali njihovo spreminjanje. To je posebej uporabno pri primerkih poročil, katerih merila vplivajo na podatke, prikazane na zaslonih zunaj poročil. Stolpci za prikaz, nastavljeni v povzetku dnevnika stikov, na primer vplivajo na stolpce na zavihku »Dnevnik sprememb« posameznega stika."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Form/Tabs/Settings.hlp
msgid ""
"Selecting Yes will set the report to be visible only to the user\n"
"  that clicked this option and saved the report settings form. If this is\n"
"  enabled, the permissions configuration for this report will be disabled."
msgstr "Če izberete »Da«, bo poročilo vidno samo uporabniku, ki je kliknil to možnost in shranil obrazec z nastavitvami poročila.\n  Če je ta možnost omogočena, bo nastavitev dovoljenj za to poročilo onemogočena."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/InstanceList.tpl
msgid "View All Reports"
msgstr "Prikaži vsa poročila"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/InstanceList.tpl
msgid "Run this report"
msgstr "Zaženi to poročilo"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/InstanceList.tpl
msgid ""
"You do not have any private reports. To add a report to this section, edit "
"the Report Settings for a report and set 'Add to My Reports' to Yes."
msgstr "Nimate zasebnih poročil. Če želite poročilo dodati v ta razdelek, uredite njegove nastavitve in možnost »Dodaj med moja poročila« nastavite na »Da«."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/InstanceList.tpl
msgid "No %1 reports have been created."
msgstr "Ustvarjeno ni bilo nobeno poročilo %1."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/InstanceList.tpl
msgid "No reports have been created."
msgstr "Ustvarjeno ni bilo nobeno poročilo."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/InstanceList.tpl
msgid ""
"You can create reports by selecting from the <a href=\"%1\">list of report "
"templates here.</a>"
msgstr "Poročila lahko ustvarite tako, da jih izberete na <a href=\"%1\">seznamu predlog poročil.</a>"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/InstanceList.tpl
msgid "Contact your site administrator for help creating reports."
msgstr "Za pomoč pri ustvarjanju poročil se obrnite na skrbnika spletnega mesta."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/Options.tpl
msgid "Register New %1"
msgstr "Registriraj nov element %1"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/Options.tpl
msgid "There are no option values entered. You can <a href=\"%1\">add one</a>."
msgstr "Vnesena ni nobena vrednost možnosti. Lahko jo <a href=\"%1\">dodate</a>."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/TemplateList.tpl
msgid ""
"Create reports from any of the report templates listed below. Click on a "
"template title to get started. Click Existing Reports to see any reports "
"that have already been created from that template."
msgstr "Ustvarite poročila iz katere koli spodaj navedene predloge. Za začetek kliknite naslov predloge. Kliknite »Obstoječa poročila«, da si ogledate poročila, ki so že bila ustvarjena iz te predloge."

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/TemplateList.tpl
msgid "Create report from this template"
msgstr "Ustvari poročilo iz te predloge"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/TemplateList.tpl
msgid "Existing Reports"
msgstr "Obstoječa poročila"

#: templates/CRM/Report/Page/TemplateList.tpl
